msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course I do...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How could I ⟪k:3⟫not⟪k:4⟫ know who you are?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫当然了……⟪k:1⟫这是肯定的……"

