msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_148F91BC_E4C1_467E_B6E2_A38C3FA5AEE7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s not why I sought the truth...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Not because I wanted to see anyone "
"“extinguished”..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我……⟪k:1⟫并不是为了消灭谁……⟪k:2⟫才努力至此的……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_04875D08_CAE1_4730_9063_7003DD5C6999
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1ce3cbded0884f7eef843377ab789fae9b129132d5defcbfe904062a0951436
#. default-sha256: d927d948c0131288debdd1a9d8a05384b374baea5240993e674de3347f8ea4ad
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_04875D08_CAE1_4730_9063_7003DD5C6999"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because I wanted to put an ⟪k:1⟫end⟪k:2⟫ to this cycle of pain and suffering..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为了斩断这……⟪k:1⟫害人害己的连锁……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_DE0645BD_A94B_49F2_97B1_549192018D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 132c252ddacdd26984d7befbb30a5159f9d142ce3ac069eb85c813d52a8e038e
